    "collapsible_content_TLFeDA": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_BxFHR4": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Shipping Information",
            "icon": "truck",
            "row_content": "<p>We ship worldwide via FedEx, DHL, and Sea Shipping. Shipping costs are not included in the product price due to the premium courier service we use.</p><ul><li><strong>Standard orders (FedEx & DHL):</strong> Delivered in 3–5 days</li><li><strong>Large or wholesale orders:</strong> After your order is confirmed, you will receive a separate shipping quote before any charge is made.</li><li><strong>Sea Shipping:</strong> Delivered in 25–30 days. Pricing is calculated based on weight (kg). Includes tracking information, though delivery times are slower than express options. Ideal for large orders and cost-conscious customers.</li><li><strong>Europe Shipping:</strong> We partner with 2 trusted companies that specialize in ceramic packaging with an excellent track record for reliability. We serve the UK, France, Spain, and Germany with reasonable pricing. Payment terms: 50% before shipping, 50% on delivery. All shipments include tracking, and our transporter provides WhatsApp support for customer assistance throughout the delivery process.</li></ul><p>We'll always confirm with you before proceeding.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_VTryG3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Returns & Exchanges",
            "icon": "return",
            "row_content": "<p>We want you to be completely satisfied with your Tamegroute pottery. If you're not happy with your purchase, we offer a hassle-free return policy.</p><p><strong>Return Policy:</strong></p><ul><li>30-day return window from delivery date</li><li>Items must be unused and in original packaging</li><li>Return shipping costs are the customer's responsibility</li><li>Refunds processed within 5-7 business days of receiving returned items</li></ul><p>For exchanges or to discuss your return, please contact us at support@tamegroutepottery.com</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_e493rz": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Delivery & Packaging",
            "icon": "box",
            "row_content": "<p>Each piece of Tamegroute pottery is handcrafted and unique. We take special care in packaging to protect your items during transit.</p><p><strong>Our Packaging Includes:</strong></p><ul><li>Protective bubble wrap and padding</li><li>Sturdy cardboard boxes</li><li>Fragile handling labels</li><li>Tracking information for peace of mind</li></ul><p>If your item arrives damaged, please contact us immediately with photos, and we'll work with you to resolve the issue. Your satisfaction is our priority.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_xeEjb6": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Collapsible row",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
